abstract: >-
  Project Potimos applies geometric constants from the Z² Unified Framework
  to industrial water purification. The core innovation is the 10¹²
  Frequency-Energy Scaling Bridge, connecting Z = √(32π/3) ≈ 5.79 Å to
  sonochemistry at 517.9 kHz. Includes topological filtration paradigms
  (Berry Phase Sieving, M-CISS Spin-Sieving, Soliton-Gated Membranes) and
  industrial CAD specifications for a Triple-Gate Reactor achieving
  99.95% contaminant removal at 0.22 kWh/m³.
